KZ3 patch 2117 (RSX pass 110; ENHANCEMENT, display, with 2094): the controls page picture without the L1 leader
line while the pad layout gives L1 no on-foot action (Modern = the Shadow Fall layout): the game's own picture with
the line erased (PS3 set), no L1 line on the drawn PS4/PS5 and Xbox pictures; the state is part of the prompt atlas
signature so a layout switch re-uploads the picture. main.cpp supplies layout_l1_unused. Notes
the RE notes Pass 110.

